ve.google.com/drive/folders/1h9S0JEOCsR0p6Cwp-Kiv3M5VnvDyR_nL?usp=drive_link\nI would like the male character to lead them with a confident look, and the others to follow behind him.\nThe girl with the glasses is a cool older sister type who keeps the other two under control\nThe girl with hair covering her eyes is very excitable and playful.\nI attached an image reference for thee posing, but feel free to do whatever you think works with posing if you can make it better!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zombiemiso/works/100", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fc23b09b/uploads/origins/baf67a76-02b9-41cb-b593-5fae32ea4946?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c635444616f6658a987d360a0aea3787", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fc23b09b/uploads/origins/baf67a76-02b9-41cb-b593-5fae32ea4946?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c635444616f6658a987d360a0aea3787, https://si.imgix.net/fc23b09b/uploads/origins/baf67a76-02b9-41cb-b593-5fae32ea4946?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77c37a3198f4c08ceec9aee7732fe95b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fc23b09b/uploads/origins/baf67a76-02b9-41cb-b593-5fae32ea4946?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6542c239a1e9801a98b2aa876090a44 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "またまたこんにちは！私のキャラクター、ランドール（ジャッカロープ）が、もう一人のキャラクター、ミア（バニーガール）を不気味に操っている画像をリクエストしてもいいですか？ミアは怯えていたり、悲しんでいたり、生気がないように見えるかもしれません。以下は、私のキャラクターの参考資料と、私が想像しているコンセプトイメージです：\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-OEjJF5AvC25r2HX55XMJLLZ8M8OFFiy", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}